            <div xml:id="d1101">

                <pb facs="1356" n="1342" xml:id="pg1342"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">103.9151/11–845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Trueblood</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-11-10T13:00:00-05:00">November 10,
                            1945—1 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1012. Your 1126 November 8. Endeavor to persuade Foreign Minister to have suits
                    against Rubber Development Corporation suspended pending efforts to effect
                    reasonable direct settlements. Further instructions will follow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
